 "summary": "A single small-signal diode in the two-terminal SOD-323 surface-mount package, made for fast general switching. It blocks 100 V, carries 150 mA average and 300 mA continuous forward current, and recovers in 4 ns or less. Two part numbers, BAV16WS and 1N4148WS, share one set of ratings and characteristics.",
